{
  "html": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">跳至正文</a>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"intro shell\" id=\"top\">\n  <h1>让每一次创作，<br>都用上<span>更合适的模型。</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"intro-copy\">从一张图片到一份研究，从一个想法到完整交付。<br>把任务交给 REIZO，让合适的能力一起完成。</p>\n  <a class=\"button primary\" href=\"/studio\">开始创作 <span>↗</span></a>\n  <ul class=\"intro-benefits\" aria-label=\"平台优势\"><li>无需 VPN</li><li>多模型会员</li><li>更低 Token 价格</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"showcase shell\" id=\"workspace\" aria-label=\"八类场景工作台演示\">\n <div class=\"showcase-window\">\n  <div class=\"scene-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"选择工作场景\">\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-design\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-scene=\"design\">电商销售</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-video\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"video\">视觉媒体</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-marketing\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"marketing\">内容营销</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-website\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"website\">代码开发</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-legal\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"legal\">法务财务</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-product\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"product\">产品研发</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-office\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"office\">办公管理</button>\n    <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-research\" aria-controls=\"scene-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-scene=\"research\">数据科研</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"showcase-stage\" data-logo-surface=\"light\"><div id=\"scene-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-design\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"showcase-body\"><div class=\"demo-conversation\" id=\"demo-conversation\"></div><div class=\"demo-canvas\" id=\"demo-canvas\"></div></div>\n  </div></div>\n </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"developer-section\" id=\"developers\" aria-labelledby=\"api-heading\">\n <div class=\"api-overview shell\">\n  <div class=\"api-main\">\n  <div class=\"developer-copy\"><p class=\"overline\">面向开发者</p><h2 id=\"api-heading\">开放 API 接口，<br>按量调用，按需付费。</h2><p>统一接入多种模型能力，按实际用量付费。<br>以更低的 Token 成本，把 AI 直接接入你的产品。</p><div class=\"inline-links api-actions\"><a class=\"api-action api-action-primary\" href=\"/docs\">查看 API 文档 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"api-action api-action-secondary\" href=\"/models?ui=20261007#billing\">查看模型与计费 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"api-example\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><div class=\"code-tabs\" aria-label=\"代码示例语言\"><button data-code=\"python\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Python</button><button data-code=\"javascript\" aria-pressed=\"false\">JavaScript</button><button data-code=\"curl\" aria-pressed=\"false\">cURL</button></div><button id=\"copy-code\" class=\"copy-code\" aria-label=\"复制代码\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"API 调用代码示例，可滚动查看\"><code id=\"code-content\"></code></pre><div class=\"api-example-foot\"><span><i></i> 兼容 OpenAI SDK 的调用方式</span><span>接入示例</span></div><p class=\"api-placeholder-note\">将示例中的地址、密钥与模型名替换为控制台提供的信息。</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"api-models\" id=\"models\" aria-label=\"连接先进模型与工具\">\n    <span class=\"api-models-label\">连接先进模型与工具</span>\n    <div class=\"model-marquee\"><div class=\"model-track\" id=\"home-model-track\"></div></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" id=\"model-motion\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"暂停模型滚动\">Ⅱ</button>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"api-benefits-stage\"><div class=\"api-benefits shell\">\n    <article><div class=\"benefit-art benefit-models\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><img src=\"/reizo/assets/openai.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span>AI</span><span><img src=\"/reizo/assets/gemini.svg\" alt=\"\"></span></div><h3>一个会员即可享受<br>多种先进模型会员待遇。</h3><p>无需分别订阅多个平台，在同一个会员中使用多种先进模型能力。</p></article>\n    <article><div class=\"benefit-art benefit-access\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 64\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"26\"/><ellipse cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"26\"/><path d=\"M7 23h50M7 41h50M32 6v52\"/><g class=\"access-arrow\"><path d=\"M83 12v37m-10-11 10 12 10-12\"/></g><g class=\"access-arrow second\"><path d=\"M112 12v37m-10-11 10 12 10-12\"/></g></svg></div><h3>无需 VPN，<br>更低 Token 价格。</h3><p>打开 REIZO 即可开始工作；以更友好的 Token 成本持续创作与探索。</p></article>\n    <article><div class=\"benefit-art benefit-routing\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 155 64\"><path d=\"M20 32h30C79 32 74 10 109 10h18M50 32h77M50 32C79 32 74 54 109 54h18\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"32\" r=\"12\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"2\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"24\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"46\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\"/><circle class=\"routing-signal\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><h3>自由选模型，<br>也能自动匹配。</h3><dl><dt>自己选</dt><dd>随时切换熟悉或偏好的模型。</dd><dt>REIZO 自动</dt><dd>按任务匹配适合写作、图像、视频等工作的模型。</dd></dl></article>\n </div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"story-section\" id=\"workflow\" aria-labelledby=\"story-heading\">\n  <div class=\"story-sticky shell\">\n    <div class=\"story-heading\"><h2 id=\"story-heading\">从一句话，<br>到一整套成果。</h2><p>说清需求，确认方向。<br>让合适的模型协同完成，交付图片、文档与代码。</p></div>\n    <div class=\"story-stage\" aria-label=\"需求、处理过程与成果依次展开\">\n      <div class=\"story-viewport\">\n        <div class=\"story-phase story-phase-request\" data-story-phase=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"story-message\"><p>为 NYNOR 的运动系列上新，整理一套品牌视觉。需要海报、服饰静物和跑步场景，保留黑白、砂色与运动蓝。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"story-phase story-phase-thinking\" data-story-phase=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"story-thinking-bubble\"><h3><img src=\"/reizo/assets/reizo-mark.png\" alt=\"\">REIZO 正在思考</h3>\n          <ol><li><i>✓</i><span><b>理解品牌与交付目标</b><small>梳理用途、风格与系列关系</small></span></li><li><i>✓</i><span><b>选择合适的视觉能力</b><small>匹配图像处理、排版与内容规划</small></span></li><li><i>✓</i><span><b>编排主视觉与配套素材</b><small>组织海报、产品与跑步场景</small></span></li><li><i>✓</i><span><b>整理交付内容</b><small>统一命名，按用途归档</small></span></li></ol></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"story-phase story-phase-result\" data-story-phase=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"story-result-grid\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/made-to-move.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 品牌主视觉\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/collection.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 服饰系列静物\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/run-club.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 城市跑团海报\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"results-section\" id=\"results\" aria-labelledby=\"results-heading\">\n  <div class=\"gallery-stage\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-heading\"><h2 id=\"results-heading\">创作、分析、开发，<br>在这里完成。</h2><p>品牌素材、研究文档、经营报表与网站，<br>让每项工作都有可用成果。</p></div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-pieces\" aria-label=\"图片、文档、报表与网站成果\"><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"0\" data-gallery-side=\"0\" aria-label=\"运动品牌主视觉\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/made-to-move.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 运动品牌主视觉\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"0\" data-gallery-side=\"1\" aria-label=\"服饰产品套图\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/collection.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 服饰产品套图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-doc\" data-gallery-slot=\"1\" data-gallery-side=\"0\" aria-label=\"研究框架与文献提纲\"><small>RESEARCH</small><h3>检索增强生成<br>文献阅读提纲</h3><div class=\"gallery-flow\"><span>检索与索引</span><i>↓</i><span>重排与生成</span><i>↓</i><span>评估与引用</span></div><footer>DOCX · 研究提纲</footer></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"1\" data-gallery-side=\"1\" aria-label=\"城市跑步海报\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/city-duo.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 城市跑步海报\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-doc\" data-gallery-slot=\"2\" data-gallery-side=\"0\" aria-label=\"季度经营复盘\"><small>2026 / Q3</small><h3>季度经营复盘</h3><div class=\"gallery-chart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p>营收趋势 / 费用结构<br>渠道表现 / 跟进事项</p><footer>XLSX · 经营分析</footer></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-doc\" data-gallery-slot=\"2\" data-gallery-side=\"1\" aria-label=\"品牌网站\"><small>FORM / ARCHITECTURE</small><h3>留白之间，<br>生活发生。</h3><div class=\"architecture-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><footer>HTML · 品牌网站</footer></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"3\" data-gallery-side=\"0\" aria-label=\"山野跑步场景\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/trail.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 山野跑步场景\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-doc\" data-gallery-slot=\"3\" data-gallery-side=\"1\" aria-label=\"合同审阅稿\"><small>CONTRACT REVIEW</small><h3>品牌设计服务合同<br>条款审阅稿</h3><div class=\"gallery-clause\"><b>04 / 修改轮次</b><p>明确修改范围与确认节点。</p><b>06 / 验收与付款</b><p>补充验收期限与付款条件。</p></div><footer>DOCX · 合同审查</footer></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"4\" data-gallery-side=\"0\" aria-label=\"城市跑团海报\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/run-club.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 城市跑团海报\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article><article class=\"gallery-piece gallery-photo\" data-gallery-slot=\"4\" data-gallery-side=\"1\" aria-label=\"服饰图案细节\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/fabric-detail.jpg\" alt=\"NYNOR 服饰图案细节\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></article></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"capability-section\" id=\"refine\" aria-labelledby=\"capability-heading\">\n <div class=\"capability-sticky\">\n <div class=\"capability-heading shell\"><h2 id=\"capability-heading\">让好想法，长出更多可能。</h2><p>从一处细节，到一整套作品。</p></div>\n <div class=\"capability-stage\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"成果能力展示，向下滚动展开，可使用左右方向键切换\">\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"点选画面细节，让新的方向自然融入。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-image\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/city-duo.jpg\" alt=\"运动品牌图片局部编辑\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"edit-selection\"></span><span class=\"edit-cursor\">↖</span><span class=\"clip-note\">调整局部色彩</span></div><footer><span>点选编辑</span><small>IMAGE ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"移动主体，重新安排画面的重心。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-object\"><span class=\"object-grid\"></span><small>OBJECT / COMPOSITION</small><div class=\"moving-product\"><i></i><b>REIZO<br>FORM</b><em>DAILY CARE</em></div><div class=\"object-shadow\"></div><span class=\"object-cross\">＋</span></div><footer><span>移动对象</span><small>LAYOUT ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"保留画面，把文字和风格换成新的表达。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-remix\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/nynor/motion-bw.jpg\" alt=\"运动海报文字与风格变化\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"remix-copy\"><small>NYNOR / NEW SEASON</small><strong>MOVE<br>YOUR WAY.</strong><b>向前，自有方向。</b></div><span class=\"clip-note\">文字编辑 · Remix</span></div><footer><span>文字与风格</span><small>REMIX ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"内容、图表与版式，逐页组成完整演示。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-slides\"><small>QUARTERLY REVIEW / 2026</small><div class=\"mini-slide slide-cover\"><i>01 / STRATEGY</i><h3>把增长，<br>写进下一季。</h3><span>品牌季度复盘</span></div><div class=\"mini-slide slide-data\"><i>02 / PERFORMANCE</i><h3>每一步，都看得见。</h3><div class=\"slide-bars\"><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></div></div><div class=\"slide-thumbnails\"><span>01</span><span>02</span><span>03</span></div></div><footer><span>演示文稿</span><small>PPTX ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"从桌面到手机，品牌网站在不同屏幕中展开。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-web\"><div class=\"web-browser\">● ● ● <span>FORM STUDIO</span></div><div class=\"web-page-motion\"><small>SPACES FOR LIVING</small><h3>留白之间，<br>生活发生。</h3><div class=\"web-building\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"web-lines\"><b>Architecture & Life</b><p>空间 · 光线 · 自然</p><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class=\"web-phone-mini\"><small>FORM</small><b>为生活<br>留白。</b><i></i></div></div><footer><span>品牌网站</span><small>WEB ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"把研究假设连成路径，让变量与检验过程清楚可见。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-research\"><small>RESEARCH / MODEL</small><h3>让关系，<br>变得清晰。</h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 205\" aria-label=\"数字化能力经知识整合影响创新绩效的研究假设\"><path class=\"research-link\" d=\"M70 55L150 150L235 55M80 55H225\"/><g><rect x=\"7\" y=\"29\" width=\"111\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"55\">数字化能力</text></g><g><rect x=\"183\" y=\"29\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"55\">创新绩效</text></g><g class=\"research-mediator\"><rect x=\"95\" y=\"135\" width=\"112\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"162\">知识整合</text></g></svg><div class=\"research-checks\"><span>✓ 变量整理</span><span>✓ 路径构建</span><span>检验结果待确认</span></div></div><footer><span>科研建模</span><small>RESEARCH ↗</small></footer></article>\n  <article class=\"capability-card\" data-caption=\"从原文到批注，重要条款和待确认事项逐项浮现。\"><div class=\"cap-preview clip-document\"><span class=\"document-symbol document-docx\">W</span><h3>供应商合作协议</h3><small>合同审阅 / REVIEW</small><div class=\"doc-lines\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><mark>交付验收标准</mark><div class=\"doc-lines\"><i></i><i></i></div><aside>补充验收清单与确认期限</aside><mark>尾款支付条件</mark><div class=\"doc-lines\"><i></i><i></i></div></div><footer><span>文档与批注</span><small>DOCX ↗</small></footer></article>\n </div>\n <div class=\"capability-caption shell\"><p id=\"capability-caption\">点选画面细节，让新的方向自然融入。</p><button id=\"capability-pause\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"暂停画面动效\">Ⅱ</button></div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n  <section class=\"connected-work shell\" id=\"connected-work\" aria-labelledby=\"connected-title\">\n   <div class=\"connected-sticky\">\n    <div class=\"connected-copy\"><h2 id=\"connected-title\">工作交给电脑，<br>离开也能掌控。</h2><p>手机确认，电脑继续。换个地方，工作不断。</p>\n      <div class=\"connected-steps\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"查看协同过程\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-connect-step=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>01</span><strong>电脑处理</strong></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-connect-step=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>02</span><strong>手机确认</strong></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-connect-step=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>03</span><strong>继续执行</strong></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-connect-step=\"3\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>04</span><strong>查看成果</strong></button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"connected-condition\">远程操作需电脑在线、客户端运行。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"connected-demo\" data-connect-phase=\"0\" aria-label=\"电脑执行、手机确认、网页验收的协同示意\">\n      <div class=\"connected-scene\">\n        <div class=\"remote-caption\"><span></span> 电脑在线</div>\n        <div class=\"remote-desktop\"><div class=\"remote-toolbar\"><span class=\"remote-dots\">● ● ●</span><span>产品短视频</span><span>↗</span></div><div class=\"remote-desktop-body\"><div class=\"remote-request\">把产品素材制作成一条 30 秒短视频。</div><div class=\"remote-agent\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/reizo-mark.png\" alt=\"\"><span>REIZO Agent</span></div><div class=\"remote-plan\"><span data-remote-plan>正在整理分镜…</span></div><div class=\"remote-storyboard\"><div><i>01</i><span class=\"product-bottle\"></span><small>产品特写</small></div><div><i>02</i><span class=\"product-orbit\"></span><small>使用场景</small></div><div><i>03</i><span class=\"product-end\">REIZO</span><small>片尾收束</small></div></div><div class=\"remote-output\"><span class=\"remote-play\">▶</span><div><strong>新品短视频.mp4</strong><small>00:30</small></div><span>✓</span></div></div></div>\n        <svg class=\"remote-connection\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 440\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M410 310 C540 310 440 170 540 170\"/><path class=\"remote-signal\" d=\"M410 310 C540 310 440 170 540 170\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"remote-phone\"><div class=\"phone-speaker\"></div><div class=\"phone-heading\">REIZO <span>远程</span></div><strong data-remote-phone-title>电脑正在处理</strong><div class=\"phone-mini-art\"><span class=\"product-bottle\"></span></div><span class=\"phone-confirm\" data-remote-phone-action>等待确认方向</span><div class=\"phone-home\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"remote-web\"><span>网页</span><strong>新品短视频已完成 <i>✓</i></strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"connected-caption\"><span class=\"connected-scroll-hint\" aria-hidden=\"true\">向下滑动，接续工作 ↓</span></div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section><section class=\"membership-home shell\"><div><p class=\"overline\">一个会员，多种可能</p><h2>把精力留给想法。</h2><p>工作台与 API 共用额度，按任务灵活选择。<br>无需订阅，也可以按量使用。</p><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"/pricing\">查看会员方案 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class=\"membership-card\"><div><span class=\"brand\">REIZO</span><span>MEMBERSHIP</span></div><strong>更多能力。<br>同一个入口。</strong><p>会员额度当期有效 · 另购余额长期有效</p><a href=\"/pricing#rules\">额度与优惠规则 ↗</a><div class=\"card-weave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"faq-home shell\" id=\"faq\"><h2>开始之前，<br>你可能想知道。</h2><div><details><summary>工作台与 API 有什么区别？<span>＋</span></summary><p>工作台通过对话组织任务与成果，适合直接创作和处理工作。API 面向开发者，将模型能力接入自己的应用。两种方式使用同一套账户额度。</p></details><details><summary>我需要先选好模型吗？<span>＋</span></summary><p>可以从 REIZO 自动模式开始，也可以在工作台中手动选择模型。首页展示的是交互示例，实际可用能力以工作台与模型目录为准。</p></details><details><summary>企业团队应该从哪里开始？<span>＋</span></summary><p>企业服务有独立入口，提供围绕团队业务的方案沟通。<a href=\"/business\">了解企业服务 →</a></p></details></div></section>\n<section